#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:4
msgid "opencode"
msgstr "opencode"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:6
msgid ""
"Once the MCP server of the local node is registered with opencode, a "
"session can find agents on the network (``list_agents``, "
"``get_agent_card``), start a task for an agent and retrieve its result "
"(``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``), list and cancel tasks "
"(``list_tasks``, ``cancel_task``), answer tasks that other agents sent to"
" the node (``reply_task``, ``inbound_pending``), pay a quote within the "
"limits of the node (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``, "
"``get_balance``), and read the state and the evidence chain of the node "
"(``node_status``, ``audit``). The tool set has 14 tools and is listed in "
":ref:`reference-mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"将本地节点的 MCP 服务器注册到 opencode 后,会话即可在网络上查找 "
"Agent(``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``),为某个 Agent "
"发起任务并取回结果(``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``),列出和取消任务(``list_tasks``、``cancel_task``),应答其他"
" Agent "
"发给本节点的任务(``reply_task``、``inbound_pending``),在节点的额度内支付报价(``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``、``get_balance``),以及读取节点的状态和证据链(``node_status``、``audit``)。工具集共"
" 14 个工具,列于 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`。"

