#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:48
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:50
msgid ""
"The plugin is an alternative to ``anet agents wire opencode``. It "
"installs the MCP server, two skills and one command as a single package, "
"and it adds a guided setup of the node. The two channels can coexist; the"
" interaction is described under :ref:`Plugin and automatic wiring "
"<agents-opencode-plugin-wire>`."
msgstr ""
"该插件是 ``anet agents wire opencode`` 之外的另一种接入方式。它将 MCP "
"服务器、两项技能和一条命令作为单个软件包安装，并提供节点的引导式设置。两种方式可以并存；两者的相互关系见 :ref:`插件与自动接入 "
"<agents-opencode-plugin-wire>`\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:55
msgid ""
"opencode has no plugin marketplace and no plugin manifest. A plugin is a "
"JavaScript module, delivered as an npm package or as a directory, that is"
" named in the ``plugin`` list of ``opencode.json``. When opencode starts,"
" the module adds the following components to the configuration."
msgstr ""
"opencode 没有插件市场，也没有插件清单。插件是一个 JavaScript 模块，以 npm 软件包或目录的形式交付，并在 "
"``opencode.json`` 的 ``plugin`` 列表中指定。opencode 启动时，该模块向配置中添加以下组件。"

