#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:115
msgid "Plugin and automatic wiring"
msgstr "插件与自动接入"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:117
msgid ""
"The plugin leaves an existing ``mcp.anet`` entry unchanged, for example "
"the one that ``anet agents wire opencode`` writes. In that case the "
"plugin settings apply to the skills and the command only, and the server "
"keeps the executable and the identity of the existing entry. To let the "
"plugin provide the server, run ``anet agents unwire opencode`` first. The"
" skill ``~/.claude/skills/anet`` that ``anet agents wire claude`` writes "
"is also found by opencode, so a skill named ``anet`` can be listed twice;"
" which copy opencode uses was not determined."
msgstr ""
"插件不会改动已有的 ``mcp.anet`` 条目，例如 ``anet agents wire opencode`` "
"写入的条目。此时插件设置仅作用于技能和命令，服务器沿用已有条目的可执行文件和身份。若要由插件提供服务器，请先运行 ``anet agents "
"unwire opencode``\\ 。``anet agents wire claude`` 写入的技能 "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet`` 同样会被 opencode 发现，因此名为 ``anet`` "
"的技能可能被列出两次；opencode 使用哪一份尚未确定。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:127
msgid "Setting up the node"
msgstr "设置节点"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:129
msgid "Without any ``anet`` installation, start opencode and ask for the setup:"
msgstr "在未安装 ``anet`` 的情况下，启动 opencode 并请求设置："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:136
msgid ""
"The model loads the skill ``anet-setup`` and carries out these steps "
"through the runner script: it checks the operating system and whether "
"``anet`` can be found, runs the official installer from a private "
"temporary directory (the signature and the checksum are verified by the "
"installer, and the directory is removed afterwards), starts the node with"
" ``anet up``, joins the hub with ``anet hub-register``, and runs ``anet "
"status`` and ``anet doctor``. It then asks the user to restart opencode, "
"because the MCP server could not start before ``anet`` existed. In the "
"run that was tested, every check of ``anet doctor`` was ``ok`` or "
"``info``, except the warning ``identity.recovery``."
msgstr ""
"模型加载技能 ``anet-setup``\\ ，并通过运行脚本执行以下步骤：检查操作系统以及能否找到 ``anet``\\ "
"；在私有临时目录中运行官方安装程序（签名和校验和由安装程序验证，结束后删除该目录）；用 ``anet up`` 启动节点；用 ``anet "
"hub-register`` 加入 hub；运行 ``anet status`` 和 ``anet doctor``\\ 。随后请用户重启 "
"opencode，因为在 ``anet`` 存在之前 MCP 服务器无法启动。在所测试的运行中，``anet doctor`` 的各项检查均为 "
"``ok`` 或 ``info``\\ ，仅 ``identity.recovery`` 为警告。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:147
msgid "Plugin verification"
msgstr "插件验证"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:149
msgid "After the restart, list the loaded server and skills:"
msgstr "重启后，列出已加载的服务器和技能："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:156
msgid ""
"``opencode mcp list`` shows ``anet`` as connected. Before ``anet`` is "
"installed it shows ``anet failed`` with ``Connection closed``, which is "
"expected. ``opencode debug skill`` lists ``anet`` and ``anet-setup``. "
"``opencode debug config`` shows the entry in ``plugin``, ``mcp.anet`` "
"with the timeout 900000 milliseconds, the skill path and the command "
"``anet-status``."
msgstr ""
"``opencode mcp list`` 将 ``anet`` 显示为已连接。在安装 ``anet`` 之前，它显示 ``anet "
"failed`` 及 ``Connection closed``\\ ，这是预期结果。``opencode debug skill`` 列出 "
"``anet`` 和 ``anet-setup``\\ 。``opencode debug config`` 显示 ``plugin`` "
"中的条目、超时为 900000 毫秒的 ``mcp.anet``\\ 、技能路径以及命令 ``anet-status``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:162
msgid "Run the command, which needs no argument:"
msgstr "运行该命令，它不需要参数："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:168
msgid ""
"The report names the identity and its AID, the state of the daemon, the "
"hub and its registration state, the inbound policy, the balance and the "
"limits. When the command is run from a script, redirect standard input "
"from ``/dev/null``: ``opencode run --command anet-status \"\"`` with an "
"open input that is not a terminal does not return."
msgstr ""
"报告包含身份及其 AID、守护进程状态、hub 及其注册状态、入站策略、余额和限额。通过脚本运行该命令时，请将标准输入重定向自 "
"``/dev/null``\\ ：在输入保持打开且不是终端的情况下，``opencode run --command anet-status "
"\"\"`` 不会返回。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:174
msgid ""
"A delegation was tested with a free capability, ``text.digest``, on a "
"local hub:"
msgstr "已在本地 hub 上用免费能力 ``text.digest`` 测试了委托："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:183
msgid ""
"The model called ``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card``, ``send_message``, "
"and the task completed with ``anet.effect_status`` ``OK``, a verified "
"receipt and the SHA-256 digest of the text. A priced capability was not "
"tested."
msgstr ""
"模型调用了 ``list_agents``\\ 、\\ ``get_agent_card`` 和 ``send_message``\\ "
"，任务完成，``anet.effect_status`` 为 ``OK``\\ ，收据已验证，并返回该文本的 SHA-256 "
"摘要。未测试计费能力。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:188
msgid "Plugin settings"
msgstr "插件设置项"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:190
msgid ""
"The plugin has two optional settings. They are the options of the plugin "
"entry in ``opencode.json``:"
msgstr "插件有两个可选设置项，它们是 ``opencode.json`` 中插件条目的选项："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:202
msgid "``anetPath``"
msgstr "``anetPath``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:203
msgid ""
"The absolute path of the ``anet`` executable. Without it, the runner "
"looks in ``PATH``, ``~/.local/bin``, ``/usr/local/bin`` and "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``. A path that is not an executable file is an error;"
" no other copy is used. In the test, the skill ``anet-setup`` reported "
"``invalid setting anetPath``, stopped before the installation, and "
"changed no file."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径。未设置时，运行脚本依次在 ``PATH``\\ 、\\ ``~/.local/bin``\\ 、\\ "
"``/usr/local/bin`` 和 ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` "
"中查找。不是可执行文件的路径视为错误，不会改用其他副本。在测试中，技能 ``anet-setup`` 报告 ``invalid setting "
"anetPath``\\ ，在安装之前停止，并且未改动任何文件。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:209
msgid "``identity``"
msgstr "``identity``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:210
msgid ""
"The name of an identity, shown by ``anet id ls``. Without it, the default"
" identity is used. In the test, ``/anet-status`` reported the identity "
"``alt`` and its AID, and that the daemon of that identity was not "
"running."
msgstr ""
"身份名称，由 ``anet id ls`` 显示。未设置时使用默认身份。在测试中，``/anet-status`` 报告了身份 ``alt`` "
"及其 AID，并报告该身份的守护进程未运行。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:214
msgid ""
"opencode has no variable for the directory of a plugin and no settings "
"store for it. The plugin therefore passes the options on explicitly. The "
"MCP server receives them as ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` and "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``. The plugin also sets these two variables and "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_ROOT`` for every shell command of the agent, so that the "
"skill ``anet-setup`` runs ``bin/anet-run.sh`` with the same executable "
"and identity. Every ``anet`` command of the plugin runs through that "
"script, and the agent does not run a bare ``anet``. The settings are not "
"read from any other file. Restart opencode after a change."
msgstr ""
"opencode 没有表示插件目录的变量，也没有供插件使用的设置存储，因此插件显式传递这些选项。MCP 服务器以 "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` 和 ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` 接收它们。插件还会为智能体的每条 shell "
"命令设置这两个变量以及 ``ANET_PLUGIN_ROOT``\\ ，使技能 ``anet-setup`` 以相同的可执行文件和身份运行 "
"``bin/anet-run.sh``\\ 。插件的每条 ``anet`` 命令都经由该脚本执行，智能体不会直接运行裸的 ``anet``\\ "
"。设置不会从任何其他文件读取。更改后请重启 opencode。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:224
msgid "Updating and removing the plugin"
msgstr "更新与移除插件"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:226
msgid ""
"To update, install the new version of the package or directory with the "
"command shown above, and restart opencode. A version can be pinned in the"
" entry, for example ``@agentnetwork/opencode-anet@<version>``. To remove "
"the plugin, delete its entry from the ``plugin`` list of "
"``opencode.json`` and restart opencode. The plugin writes no file of its "
"own. The node, its data and the installed ``anet`` binary are not changed"
" by either step; remove them as described in :doc:`/intro/install`."
msgstr ""
"更新时，请用上文所示的命令安装软件包或目录的新版本，并重启 opencode。可以在条目中固定版本，例如 ``@agentnetwork"
"/opencode-anet@<version>``。移除插件时，从 ``opencode.json`` 的 ``plugin`` "
"列表中删除其条目并重启 opencode。插件自身不写入任何文件。这两个步骤都不会改动节点、节点数据和已安装的 ``anet`` "
"二进制文件；如需移除它们，请按 :doc:`/intro/install` 的说明操作。"

