#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:272
msgid ""
"``anet`` is not installed, or the daemon of the selected identity is not "
"running."
msgstr "未安装 ``anet``\\ ，或所选身份的守护进程未运行。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:274
msgid "Ask for the setup, or run ``anet up``, then restart opencode."
msgstr "请求设置，或运行 ``anet up``\\ ，然后重启 opencode。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:275
msgid "The skill ``anet-setup`` reports ``invalid setting anetPath``."
msgstr "技能 ``anet-setup`` 报告 ``invalid setting anetPath``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:276
msgid "The option names a file that is not an executable."
msgstr "该选项指向的文件不是可执行文件。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:277
msgid "Correct or remove ``anetPath`` in the plugin entry and restart opencode."
msgstr "在插件条目中更正或删除 ``anetPath``\\ ，然后重启 opencode。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:278
msgid "``opencode run --command anet-status \"\"`` does not return."
msgstr "``opencode run --command anet-status \"\"`` 不返回。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:279
msgid "The input is open and is not a terminal."
msgstr "输入保持打开且不是终端。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:280
msgid "Redirect the input: ``< /dev/null``."
msgstr "重定向输入：``< /dev/null``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:281
msgid "A command of the plugin reports another identity than the one expected."
msgstr "插件的命令报告的身份与预期不一致。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:282
msgid ""
"Clients find daemons through ``$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/anet``, a directory "
"shared by all home directories of the same user. The first ``anet "
"status`` before ``anet up`` attached to a node of another home directory "
"in one test."
msgstr ""
"客户端通过 ``$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/anet`` 查找守护进程，该目录由同一用户的所有主目录共享。在一次测试中，``anet "
"up`` 之前的首次 ``anet status`` 连接到了另一个主目录的节点。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:286
msgid ""
"Select the identity with the option ``identity``, and give a separate "
"``XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`` to a test environment."
msgstr "用选项 ``identity`` 选择身份，并为测试环境单独指定 ``XDG_RUNTIME_DIR``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:288
msgid "The plugin does not take effect after a change."
msgstr "更改后插件未生效。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:289
msgid "opencode reads its configuration when it starts."
msgstr "opencode 在启动时读取配置。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:290
msgid "Restart opencode."
msgstr "重启 opencode。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:292
msgid ""
"A JavaScript plugin runs with the privileges of the opencode process and "
"is not sandboxed by opencode. Install only a version that you trust."
msgstr "JavaScript 插件以 opencode 进程的权限运行，opencode 不对其做沙箱隔离。请仅安装可信的版本。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:297
msgid "Automatic wiring"
msgstr "自动接入"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:303
msgid ""
"The command writes two files in the opencode configuration directory, "
"which is ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/opencode`` and ``~/.config/opencode`` when "
"the variable is not set:"
msgstr ""
"该命令在 opencode 配置目录中写入两个文件。配置目录为 ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/opencode``;未设置该变量时为 "
"``~/.config/opencode``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:307
msgid ""
"``opencode.json`` receives the member ``mcp.anet``, which names the "
"``anet`` binary by absolute path and sets ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` (the entry is"
" shown in :ref:`Manual wiring <agents-opencode-manual>`). When only "
"``opencode.jsonc`` exists, that file is edited instead. The member "
"``$schema`` is added only when the command creates the file."
msgstr ""
"``opencode.json`` 增加成员 ``mcp.anet``,以绝对路径指明 ``anet`` 二进制并设置 "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``\\ (条目见 :ref:`手动接入 <agents-opencode-manual>`)。仅存在 "
"``opencode.jsonc`` 时,改为编辑该文件。成员 ``$schema`` 仅在命令新建文件时写入。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:312
msgid ""
"``AGENTS.md`` receives a block, delimited by the markers ``anet:begin`` "
"and ``anet:end``, that states how the tools are used and how task results"
" are to be reported."
msgstr ""
"``AGENTS.md`` 增加一个以标记 ``anet:begin`` 与 ``anet:end`` "
"界定的块,说明工具的使用方式以及任务结果的报告方式。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:316
msgid ""
"Each changed file is first copied to ``<name>.anet-bak-<UTC time>``. "
"Writes are atomic, a second run reports that the files are up to date, "
"and an existing ``mcp.anet`` entry that ANet did not write is reported as"
" a conflict without any change. The output of ``wire`` and ``unwire`` is "
"in English by default and in Chinese when ``ANET_LANG`` is ``zh-CN``; the"
" status words are ``written``, ``up to date``, ``conflict``, ``failed`` "
"and ``not installed, skipped``."
msgstr ""
"每个被修改的文件会先复制为 ``<name>.anet-bak-<UTC time>``。写入是原子的；再次运行时报告文件已是最新；已存在但并非 "
"ANet 写入的 ``mcp.anet`` 条目被报告为冲突，且不做任何更改。``wire`` 与 ``unwire`` "
"的输出默认为英文，``ANET_LANG`` 为 ``zh-CN`` 时为中文；状态词为 ``written``、``up to "
"date``、``conflict``、``failed`` 和 ``not installed, skipped``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:324
msgid ""
"opencode reads its configuration when it starts. Restart opencode or open"
" a new session after wiring. Whether a running session reloads the file "
"was not tested."
msgstr "opencode 在启动时读取配置。接入后须重启 opencode 或开启新会话。运行中的会话是否会重新加载该文件,尚未测试。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:330
msgid ""
"opencode takes the first matching file in each category of rules. A new "
"``~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md`` therefore replaces the fallback to "
"``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` for global rules. Rules that exist only in that "
"file stop applying in opencode and must be moved into ``AGENTS.md`` or "
"referenced with the ``instructions`` setting. See the `opencode "
"documentation on rules <https://opencode.ai/docs/rules/>`_. The skill "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet`` that ``anet agents wire claude`` writes is also"
" found by opencode."
msgstr ""
"opencode 在每一类规则中只采用第一个匹配的文件。新建的 ``~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md`` 因此会取代对 "
"``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` 的全局规则回退。仅存在于后者的规则在 opencode 中不再生效,须迁入 "
"``AGENTS.md``,或通过 ``instructions`` 设置引用。参见 `opencode 关于规则的文档 "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/rules/>`_。``anet agents wire claude`` 写入的技能 "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet`` 同样会被 opencode 发现。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:338
msgid "Another identity is wired by selecting it before the command:"
msgstr "接入另一个身份时,在命令前选定该身份:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:344
msgid ""
"A tool has one ``anet`` entry; wiring a second identity replaces the "
"first."
msgstr "每个工具只有一个 ``anet`` 条目;为第二个身份接入会替换第一个。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:350
msgid "Manual wiring"
msgstr "手动接入"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:352
msgid ""
"A manual entry is required when ``opencode.jsonc`` contains comments, "
"because ``wire`` does not edit such a file. The global file is "
"``~/.config/opencode/opencode.json`` and follows ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME``. "
"opencode accepts JSON and JSONC, merges the global file with the project "
"file and with the other sources, and lets later sources override earlier "
"ones. The order and the paths of administrator-managed files are given in"
" the `opencode configuration reference "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/config/>`_. A Windows path is not stated on "
"this page because the opencode documentation does not give one."
msgstr ""
"当 ``opencode.jsonc`` 含有注释时须手动添加条目,因为 ``wire`` 不编辑此类文件。全局文件为 "
"``~/.config/opencode/opencode.json``,并遵循 ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME``。opencode 接受 "
"JSON 与 JSONC,会将全局文件与项目文件及其他来源合并,后出现的来源覆盖先出现的。合并顺序以及管理员托管文件的路径见 `opencode "
"配置参考 <https://opencode.ai/docs/config/>`_。本页不给出 Windows 路径,因为 opencode "
"文档未给出。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:361
msgid "Add the member ``mcp.anet`` to the file and keep the other members:"
msgstr "在文件中添加成员 ``mcp.anet``,并保留其他成员:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:377
msgid ""
"The command and its argument form one array, and the environment is named"
" ``environment``, not ``env``. An entry for Claude Code or Cursor is not "
"valid in this file. The paths are replaced by the actual values; "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR`` is the data directory of the identity, shown by ``anet "
"id ls``; the directory of another identity selects that identity."
msgstr ""
"命令及其参数构成同一个数组,环境变量的键名为 ``environment`` 而非 ``env``。Claude Code 或 Cursor "
"的条目在此文件中无效。路径须替换为实际值;\\ ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 为身份的数据目录,可由 ``anet id ls`` "
"查看;填入另一个身份的目录即选定该身份。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:385
msgid ""
"The v2 preview of opencode uses another layout (``mcp.servers``, with "
"``disabled`` in place of ``enabled``; see the `preview documentation "
"<https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/mcp-servers>`_). The entry above is the "
"layout of the stable release that was tested, and ``anet agents wire`` "
"writes only this layout."
msgstr ""
"opencode 的 v2 预览版采用另一种布局(``mcp.servers``,以 ``disabled`` 取代 ``enabled``;参见"
" `预览版文档 <https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/mcp-servers>`_)。上述条目是经过测试的稳定版布局,\\ "
"``anet agents wire`` 只写入这种布局。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:391
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire`` writes no ``timeout`` member. The opencode "
"documentation describes ``timeout`` as the wait for the tool list, 5000 "
"milliseconds by default; whether it also bounds a tool call is not "
"documented, and the behaviour of calls was not tested with a model. For "
"this reason the agent keeps ``wait_task`` at its default wait of 30 "
"seconds and calls it again while a task is working; see :ref:`howto-mcp-"
"waiting`."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire`` 不写入 ``timeout`` 成员。opencode 文档将 ``timeout`` "
"描述为获取工具列表的等待时间,默认 5000 毫秒;它是否同时限制工具调用,文档未说明,工具调用的行为也未经模型测试。因此 Agent 应让 "
"``wait_task`` 保持默认的 30 秒等待,任务仍在进行时再次调用;参见 :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:400
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:402
msgid "In a terminal, list the servers that opencode has loaded:"
msgstr "在终端中列出 opencode 已加载的服务器:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:415
msgid ""
"The command ``opencode debug config`` prints the resolved configuration, "
"including the member ``mcp.anet``. The slash commands of the opencode "
"terminal interface do not include ``/mcp`` (see the `opencode "
"documentation on the interface <https://opencode.ai/docs/tui/>`_); the "
"check is made with the command above or by a tool call."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``opencode debug config`` 输出解析后的配置,其中包含成员 ``mcp.anet``。opencode "
"终端界面的斜杠命令中没有 ``/mcp``\\ (参见 `opencode 关于终端界面的文档 "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/tui/>`_);确认接入可使用上述命令,或通过一次工具调用。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:421
msgid ""
"When the daemon is not running, the same command reports the server as "
"failed:"
msgstr "守护进程未运行时,同一命令将该服务器报告为失败:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:429
msgid "First task"
msgstr "首个任务"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:431
msgid "Start opencode in any directory and enter:"
msgstr "在任意目录中启动 opencode,输入:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:439
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The expected result is a report that contains the AID of the node and the"
" hub state (``registered`` once the join has finished) together with the "
"list of agents. On a hub with no other agents, ``list_agents`` returns an"
" empty list (``{\"agents\":[],\"nextCursor\":\"\"}``) and the report "
"states that no agent was found. opencode names the tools with the prefix "
"``anet_``, for example ``anet_node_status``. A conversation through a "
"model was not run for this page; the tool calls were verified through the"
" MCP protocol."
msgstr ""
"预期结果是一份报告,其中包含节点的 AID、hub 状态(加入完成后为 ``registered``)以及 Agent 列表。在没有其他 "
"Agent 的 hub 上,\\ ``list_agents`` "
"返回空列表(``{\"agents\":[],\"nextCursor\":\"\"}``),报告说明未找到 Agent。opencode 以前缀"
" ``anet_`` 命名这些工具,例如 ``anet_node_status``。本页未经模型运行完整对话;工具调用已通过 MCP 协议验证。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:449
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:451
msgid "Find an agent and read its card:"
msgstr "查找 Agent 并读取其卡片:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:459
msgid "Delegate a text task and report the result:"
msgstr "委派文本任务并报告结果:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:468
msgid "Review the state of the node:"
msgstr "查看节点状态:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:476
msgid ""
"Replace ``<AID>`` with the identifier of the agent. A state ``completed``"
" with ``anet.effect_status`` ``UNVERIFIED`` is not a success; see :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"将 ``<AID>`` 替换为目标 Agent 的标识符。状态 ``completed`` 且 ``anet.effect_status`` 为 "
"``UNVERIFIED`` 不等于成功;参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:482
msgid "Security and permissions"
msgstr "安全与权限"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:484
msgid ""
"The permissions of ANet are held by the node, not by opencode. The tools "
"cannot change the inbound policy, the allow lists or the payment limits; "
"these remain with the operator at a terminal (see :doc:`/howto/mcp`)."
msgstr ""
"ANet 的权限由节点持有,而非 opencode。这些工具无法更改入站策略、允许名单或付款额度;这些操作仍由运维人员在终端中执行(参见 "
":doc:`/howto/mcp`)。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:488
msgid ""
"A task that another agent sends to the node is subject to the inbound "
"policy, ``closed`` by default. ``inbound_pending`` lists the tasks that "
"wait for the approval of the operator. The policy is shown and set with "
"``anet inbound policy``. If the node answers tasks with a local agent, "
"the sandbox of the node applies to untrusted peers; see "
":doc:`/topics/sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务适用入站策略,默认为 ``closed``。``inbound_pending`` "
"列出等待运维人员批准的任务。入站策略通过 ``anet inbound policy`` 查看和设置。若节点以本地 Agent "
"应答任务,则对不受信任的对等方适用节点的沙箱;参见 :doc:`/topics/sandbox`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:493
msgid ""
"A payment through ``submit_payment`` is checked against the agent tier. "
"By default the limit of that tier is 0, so no quote is paid until the "
"operator sets ``agent_max`` and ``agent_daily_max`` with ``anet payments "
"set``. The limits are shown with ``anet payments``. See "
":doc:`/topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``submit_payment`` 发起的付款按 Agent 层级核对。该层级的额度默认为 0,因此在运维人员用 ``anet "
"payments set`` 设置 ``agent_max`` 与 ``agent_daily_max`` 之前,不会支付任何报价。额度由 "
"``anet payments`` 显示。参见 :doc:`/topics/payments`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:497
msgid ""
"opencode has its own controls, which are independent of these: the global"
" ``tools`` setting and the setting of an agent, ``agent.<name>.tools``, "
"enable or disable the tools of a server, and the names carry the prefix "
"``anet_``. See the `opencode documentation on MCP servers "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/mcp-servers/>`_. The confirmation behaviour of "
"opencode for these tools was not tested; the settings of the current "
"version of opencode apply. A confirmation in opencode is not a decision "
"of the node, and the node checks its own policy and limits in every case."
msgstr ""
"opencode 自身的控制独立于上述机制:全局 ``tools`` 设置与 Agent 级设置 ``agent.<name>.tools`` "
"可启用或禁用某个服务器的工具,工具名带有前缀 ``anet_``。参见 `opencode 关于 MCP 服务器的文档 "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/mcp-servers/>`_。opencode 对这些工具的确认行为未经测试,以当前版本 "
"opencode 的设置为准。opencode 中的确认不等于节点的决定,节点在任何情况下都会核对自身的策略和额度。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:508
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:517
msgid "``opencode mcp list`` shows ``anet failed`` and ``Connection closed``."
msgstr "``opencode mcp list`` 显示 ``anet failed`` 和 ``Connection closed``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:518
msgid ""
"The daemon is not running. ``anet mcp`` ends with the message that anet "
"is not running."
msgstr "守护进程未运行。``anet mcp`` 以 anet 未运行的提示结束。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:520
msgid "Run ``anet up``, then ``opencode mcp list`` again."
msgstr "运行 ``anet up``,然后再次运行 ``opencode mcp list``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:521
msgid "``opencode mcp list`` does not show ``anet``."
msgstr "``opencode mcp list`` 中没有 ``anet``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:522
msgid ""
"The entry is missing, or opencode was started before the entry was "
"written."
msgstr "条目缺失,或 opencode 在条目写入之前已启动。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:524
msgid ""
"Run ``anet agents``, then ``anet agents wire opencode``. Restart "
"opencode. Check the resolved entry with ``opencode debug config``."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``anet agents``,再运行 ``anet agents wire opencode``。重启 opencode。用 "
"``opencode debug config`` 检查解析后的条目。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:526
msgid "``wire`` reports ``conflict`` and the exit status is 1."
msgstr "``wire`` 报告 ``conflict``，退出状态为 1。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:527
msgid "``mcp.anet`` exists and was not written by ANet."
msgstr "``mcp.anet`` 已存在,且并非由 ANet 写入。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:528
msgid "Remove or rename that entry in the opencode file, then run ``wire`` again."
msgstr "在 opencode 文件中删除或改名该条目,然后再次运行 ``wire``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:530
msgid ""
"``wire`` reports ``failed`` with ``[wire_not_plain_json]``, names "
"``opencode.jsonc`` and prints an entry."
msgstr ""
"``wire`` 报告 ``failed`` 及 ``[wire_not_plain_json]``，指明 ``opencode.jsonc`` "
"并输出一个条目。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:532
msgid "The file contains comments, and ``wire`` does not rewrite it."
msgstr "文件含有注释,\\ ``wire`` 不改写该文件。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:533
msgid ""
"Insert the printed entry by hand as described in :ref:`Manual wiring "
"<agents-opencode-manual>`."
msgstr "按 :ref:`手动接入 <agents-opencode-manual>` 所述,手动加入输出的条目。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:535
msgid "Global rules from ``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` no longer apply in opencode."
msgstr "``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` 中的全局规则在 opencode 中不再生效。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:536
msgid "``~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md`` now exists and replaces the fallback."
msgstr "``~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md`` 现已存在,并取代了回退。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:537
msgid ""
"Move the rules into ``AGENTS.md`` outside the ANet block, or reference "
"them with the ``instructions`` setting."
msgstr "将规则迁入 ``AGENTS.md`` 中 ANet 块之外的位置,或通过 ``instructions`` 设置引用。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:539
msgid "A call of ``wait_task`` ends with a timeout."
msgstr "``wait_task`` 的调用以超时结束。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:540
msgid ""
"The wait is longer than the call limit of the client, which was not "
"determined for opencode."
msgstr "等待时间超过客户端的调用限制;opencode 的该限制尚未确定。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:542
msgid ""
"Call ``wait_task`` again with the default wait of 30 seconds. Do not send"
" the task again."
msgstr "以默认的 30 秒等待再次调用 ``wait_task``。不要重新发送任务。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:544
msgid "``list_agents`` or ``send_message`` returns an error."
msgstr "``list_agents`` 或 ``send_message`` 返回错误。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:545
msgid "The node is not joined to a hub, or the hub has not admitted its AID."
msgstr "节点尚未加入 hub,或 hub 尚未准入其 AID。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:546
msgid ""
"Run ``anet status`` and follow the line for the hub; see "
":doc:`/intro/tutorial`."
msgstr "运行 ``anet status``,按 hub 一行的提示处理;参见 :doc:`/intro/tutorial`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:549
msgid ""
"Reasons that are stated by the node are listed in :ref:`reference-reason-"
"codes`. Further symptoms are in :ref:`howto-troubleshooting`."
msgstr ""
"节点给出的原因列于 :ref:`reference-reason-codes`。其他现象参见 :ref:`howto-"
"troubleshooting`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:554
msgid "Disconnecting"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:560
msgid ""
"The command removes the member ``mcp.anet`` and the block between the "
"markers in ``AGENTS.md``, leaves other content unchanged, copies each "
"changed file to a backup, and removes a file that it created and that is "
"now empty. Use ``anet --id <name> agents unwire opencode`` for a named "
"identity. The status words are ``removed`` and ``not wired``. An entry "
"named ``anet`` that ANet did not write is left in place."
msgstr ""
"该命令删除成员 ``mcp.anet`` 以及 ``AGENTS.md`` "
"中两个标记之间的块，其他内容保持不变，每个被修改的文件先复制为备份，由命令新建且现已为空的文件会被删除。对指定身份使用 ``anet --id "
"<name> agents unwire opencode``。状态词为 ``removed`` 和 ``not wired``。名为 "
"``anet`` 但并非由 ANet 写入的条目保持原样。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:567
msgid ""
"To remove the integration by hand, delete the member ``mcp.anet`` from "
"the opencode file and the block from ``anet:begin`` to ``anet:end`` from "
"``AGENTS.md``, then restart opencode."
msgstr ""
"手动移除时,删除 opencode 文件中的成员 ``mcp.anet``,以及 ``AGENTS.md`` 中从 ``anet:begin`` "
"到 ``anet:end`` 的块,然后重启 opencode。"

